 183:../libDaisy/src/hid/midi.h ****     /** Starts listening on the selected input mode(s).
 184:../libDaisy/src/hid/midi.h ****      * MidiEvent Queue will begin to fill, and can be checked with HasEvents()
 185:../libDaisy/src/hid/midi.h ****      * MIDI events of type SystemRealTime will be delivered synchronously by callback.
